# Game-derived content: never commit
assets/
app/assets/
app/generated/*
!app/generated/rexglue.cmake
app/out/
out/
*.xex
*.iso
logs/
# Build/temp
*.log
__pycache__/

# 2026-10-19 (the private GitHub upload): built and game-derived files outside out/ and app/out/
# The NRO holds the recompiled game code; shader libraries, pipeline caches and lists, DKSH caches, shader microcode
# dumps and the game file index are made from the game's data.
*.nro
*.nso
*.nacp
*.elf
*.mesp
*.mesp.idx
*.dksh
*.ucode
*.rgba
*.mp4
*.zip
dist/switch/banjo-nx/*.bin
dist/switch/banjo-nx/cache/
dist/switch/banjo-nx/newlogs*/
dist/switch/banjo-nx/capturas/
deko3d_shaders*.bin
pipeline_list*.bin
vfs_index*.bin
# Other ports' SDK and shader-tool copies this project started from (not built by it)
sdk_nfsmw/
shaders_nfsmw/
# 2026-10-20: tools/difftest's working files (a translated game shader: dp.frag/dp.dksh/dp.bin) and shtool's build output
tools/difftest/dp.*
tools/difftest/shtool/obj/
tools/difftest/shtool/bin/
# 2026-10-21: the PGO profile (.gcda files merged from an instrumented run; tools/pgo_merge.py, docs/pgo-lto.md)
pgo/
*.xexp

# nights-nx: packages (the NRO, the ELF, the generated code derived from the game)
dist/package/
out/pgo_streams/
